WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.350
Ken armors through Ryu’s Drive Impact at the wall.

2
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:04.850
Ken hits jumping heavy kick during the corner DI crumple.

3
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.850
Ken lands after jumping heavy kick, then raw Rushes into crouching heavy punch.

4
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.850
Heavy Jinrai and its heavy follow-up continue the juggle.

5
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:10.000
Heavy Shoryuken completes the corner route.
